  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero and all companions gain
    20% weapon damage and 10% movement speed per talent. Enemies also gain 10% movement
    speed per talent. This does not grant attack speed.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA community baker who led a strike when ovens fed the station
    while workers went hungry. The recipes preserve every worker's name. They seek
    a kitchen whose first meal belongs to its cooks.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional
    periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or
    special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: astral, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
